@baseUrl = {{$dotenv API_BASE_URL}}
@serverUrl = {{$dotenv SERVER_URL}}
@launcherKey = {{$dotenv LAUNCHER_API_KEY}}

### Lista de servidores (no requiere key)
GET {{baseUrl}}/launcher/servers

### Info del launcher y si necesita actualizarse (version: mínimo 5 caracteres)
GET {{baseUrl}}/launcher?version=1.2.4

### Manifest embebido en la API
GET {{baseUrl}}/launcher/manifest


# xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
#   Descargas estáticas (/downloads, fuera de /api/v2)
#   Requieren LAUNCHER_API_KEY (o SECRET_API_KEY)
# xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

### Manifest que usa el launcher para verificar archivos
GET {{serverUrl}}/downloads/Mu99bClassic/manifest.json
x-api-key: {{launcherKey}}

### ServerInfo.sse (el fileUrl de /launcher/servers)
GET {{serverUrl}}/downloads/Mu99bClassic/Client/ServerInfo.sse
x-api-key: {{launcherKey}}

### Sin key (debe responder 401)
# ⚠️ 5 fallos de key bloquean tu IP 15 minutos.
GET {{serverUrl}}/downloads/Mu99bClassic/manifest.json
